nearly 500 men and women, but it wasn't alone. What I think was striking about it, to be honest, is that, this is a kind of meta story, I suppose, it was one of the first of these kinds of events to be immortalised on film and to have that sort of Alva Liddell voice crystallising it for history, historians to pour over and to analyse and so on. So we chose the Windrush when we decided to do this,
近 500 名男女，但它并不孤单。老实说，我认为它引人注目的是，这是一种元叙事，我想，它是最早被电影永恒化，并拥有那种阿尔瓦·利德尔（Alva Liddell）式的声音为历史定格，供历史学家去研读和分析的事件之一。所以当我们决定做这件事时，我们选择了“疾风号”，

