not just because of the fact that it was mentioned in Parliament and so on, but because, frankly, there's a lot of evidence. We could tell who the people were, and we could talk to some of them. When we wrote the book in 1998, it was still possible to meet these men and women and to talk to them and interview them directly. Now there are only two of them who survive so the origins of this book which is in itself an origin story are a mixture I suppose of my own desire to tell a story about who my family is because I think at that time we were still sort of slightly two-dimensional characters you know basically people who smoked dope and got into trouble with the police and that was it at that time, we were still sort of slightly two-dimensional characters, you know, basically people who smoked dope and got into trouble with the police and that was it. And with no history
不仅仅是因为它在议会中被提及等等，而是因为，坦率地说，有大量的证据。我们可以确定这些人是谁，并且可以与他们中的一些人交谈。当我们在 1998 年写这本书时，还有可能见到这些男女并与他们交谈，直接采访他们。现在他们中只有两人健在。所以这本书的起源——它本身就是一个起源故事——我想是我个人想要讲述关于我家庭是谁的故事的混合体，因为我认为在那个时候，我们仍然是稍微有点二维的人物，你知道，基本上就是那些吸毒、惹上警察麻烦的人，当时就是这样。而且没有历史

